        "title": "The charts show the changes in ownership of electrical appliances and amount of time spent doing housework in households in one country between 1920 and 2019. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons ...",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HUQLd0RTIogyiYx8fd4l0eilg7g\"><em><strong>The charts show the changes in ownership of electrical appliances and amount of time spent doing housework in households in one country between 1920 and 2019. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Household Appliances &amp; Housework: 1920&ndash;2019</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X4yzdIpl6oHihjx4eGgliE80gAd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/task-1-line-charts\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Giới thiệu dạng Line Graphs</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MTFEdc3mUot6glxrqHUl6sHAgzf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Household Appliances &amp; Housework: 1920&ndash;2019 cho 2 charts, y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về:\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PBeMd9YNAomZqRxBFCalH6gWgfh\" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>[Line Chart 1]</strong> tỷ lệ c&aacute;c hộ gia đ&igrave;nh sở hữu ba thiết bị điện.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CHF8dwYjGo15KIxmbg0lQVUrgmh\" style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><strong>[Line Chart 2] </strong>thời gian họ bỏ ra để l&agrave;m việc nh&agrave; mỗi tuần.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IrYPdkbO7opDJ8xMCZTlxz2zglb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tuyệt đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> v&agrave; c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"> </a></strong></span>trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QSdPdXBO8ongd4xxQJYlPqr7gUd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Household Appliances &amp; Housework: 1920&ndash;2019 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: tỷ lệ hộ gia đ&igrave;nh sở hữu ba thiết bị điện - thời gian họ bỏ ra để l&agrave;m việc nh&agrave; mỗi tuần - một quốc gia - 1920 đến 2019</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NUeJdktn0ogNfGxAjkKlkOrJgOf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Học c&aacute;ch viết Introduction</strong> cho <strong>tất cả</strong> c&aacute;c b&agrave;i dạng <strong>Line Graphs</strong> ở đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute; &rarr;<strong> </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-line\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">C&aacute;ch viết Introduction dạng LINE</a></strong></span></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WbNfdFgyfoWCyQxIT4DlXX4vg0e\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng Mixed Charts, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kuf3d2oh2ocnJvxpLZjlWhwegtc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>[Line Chart 1]:</strong> tỷ lệ sở hữu cả ba thiết bị điện gia dụng đều tăng đ&aacute;ng kể | refrigeration v&agrave; vaccum cleaner trở th&agrave;nh thiết bị phổ biến trong hầu hết c&aacute;c hộ gia đ&igrave;nh.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M9AHdzJZyofmY9xnvpPl7hBSgTf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>[Line Chart 2]: </strong>số giờ h&agrave;ng tuần d&agrave;nh cho việc nh&agrave; đ&atilde; giảm r&otilde; rệt.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu4MdOZ1JoLYsQxGQNRlpNuOgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T3TYdFNlpoKwYqxWVBElweiQgib\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Line Chart 1 - tỷ lệ c&aacute;c hộ gia đ&igrave;nh sở hữu ba thiết bị điện</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A9TLdDZR2oVSPxxYqMvlldmIgWb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YAV6d4YZFoVZ8ox2EJzlqtH5gee\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu năm 1920 </strong><em>(washing machines l&agrave; phổ biến nhất, c&oacute; mặt ở 40% hộ gia đ&igrave;nh, trong khi refrigerators v&agrave; vacuum cleaners lần lượt ở mức khoảng 3% v&agrave; 30%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X9YKdUmx1oQkqgxT6IGl8FL2gOf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của refrigerator </strong>(<em><strong>tăng mạnh</strong></em><em> l&ecirc;n 100% v&agrave;o 1980, </em><em><strong>giữ nguy&ecirc;n</strong></em><em> ở mức n&agrave;y cho đến 2019)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X9YKdUmx1oQkqgxT6IGl8FL2gOf\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của vacuum cleaner </strong>(<strong>tăng đều</strong> v&agrave; đạt khoảng 70% v&agrave;o 1960, cuối c&ugrave;ng đạt 100% bằng tỷ lệ của refrigerator v&agrave;o cuối giai đoạn)</em></li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X9YKdUmx1oQkqgxT6IGl8FL2gOf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-GCVedvt4eobEKuxBCCxlXSp4gU6\">(Step 4) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của washing machine </strong>(<em><strong>tăng vừa phải</strong></em><em> đến khoảng 70% v&agrave;o 1960 v&agrave; tương đối </em><em><strong>ổn định</strong></em><em> ở giai đoạn sau đ&oacute;)</em></div>\n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SjJidtvHzoVw26xgHLelWsLcg1b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tw9Odf9Puoahuixo7LFlaAEPgtd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Line Chart 2 - thời gian c&aacute;c hộ gia đ&igrave;nh bỏ ra để l&agrave;m việc nh&agrave; mỗi tuần</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tw9Odf9Puoahuixo7LFlaAEPgtd\">Theo<strong> Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QgJZdPpVJohrj8xKdDXl09aCgXe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu năm 1920 </strong><em>(khoảng 50 giờ mỗi tuần)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KyBOdoAlroHHvGxAcj9lNsOsggh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng đến năm 1960 </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>giảm đều</strong></em><em> xuống c&ograve;n khoảng 35 giờ v&agrave;o năm 1940 v&agrave; 20 giờ v&agrave;o năm 1960)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KyBOdoAlroHHvGxAcj9lNsOsggh\" data-list=\"bullet\"><em>(</em>Step 3) <strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">M&ocirc; tả</strong><span style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> </span><strong style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">xu hướng đến năm 2019 </strong><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\">(</em><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"><strong>giảm nhẹ</strong></em><em style=\"font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Color Emoji', 'Segoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol', serif;\"> xuống c&ograve;n khoảng 15 giờ v&agrave;o năm 1980 v&agrave; cuối c&ugrave;ng l&agrave; khoảng 10 giờ v&agrave;o năm 2019)</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RuxRdF0GuoF09YxnotEl2yn7gbj\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TN6Fd9B0PohTNjxAWltlSG3sgUg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MgpOdgFa5orVtdxiKOPliFF8gih\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G0c3dGZoNomf7CxYvAslCF1Ugaf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MgpOdgFa5orVtdxiKOPliFF8gih\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RBHkdlfhtoUEXVxNYCblULEzgIc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Trong b&agrave;i n&agrave;y, để diễn đạt \"thời gian d&agrave;nh cho việc nh&agrave;\" m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể những dụng những cụm từ như \"<strong>time dedicated to household chores</strong>\" v&agrave; \"<strong>housework hours</strong>\" để tặng sự đa dạng nh&eacute;.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bp75dUwodoHUBnxRNGZlgPHegYe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ: </strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HjqedlYWKoOkwwx7TxYloKmkgYg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">In addition, there was a substantial decline in the&nbsp;<strong>time dedicated to household chores</strong>, with the weekly <strong>housework hours</strong> falling to one-fifth of the 1920 level by 2019.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 813,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
