            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OQ4mdjPwkoIgq6xpBYvlBdjZgzf\">Overall, the ownership of all three household appliances witnessed a significant upward trend throughout the given period, with refrigerators and vacuum cleaners ultimately becoming standard equipment in virtually all households. Conversely, In contrast, the weekly hours dedicated to housework declined substantially over the same timeframe.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 14297,
